# Kio source of truth

- The toolkit source of truth is `Kio/` (skills, rules, templates, scripts).
- `.cursor/` and `.claude/` are **install copies**. Do not treat edits there as done unless `Kio/` is updated too.
- After changing something in `Kio/`, re-run the install script into the target workspace when the user wants copies refreshed.
- `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` at workspace root are workspace guidance; starter templates live in `Kio/templates/`.
